units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
processors ${ranks} 1 1
region cell block 0 20 0 16 0 16
create_box 3 cell
mass 1 1.008
mass 2 12.011
mass 3 15.999
create_atoms 1 single 9.88 8.0 8.0 units box
create_atoms 3 single 6.44 8.0 8.0 units box
create_atoms 2 single 13.47 8.25 8.0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 10.8 7.4 8.1 units box
create_atoms 3 single 7.5 9.0 8.4 units box
create_atoms 1 single 12.0 8.8 9.1 units box
create_atoms 2 single 0.65 5.6 6.1 units box
create_atoms 3 single 19.15 5.1 6.1 units box
plugin load ${plugin}
pair_style mace/native ${model}
pair_coeff * * H C O
neighbor 0.1 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check no
group crossing id 1
group rest subtract all crossing
fix move1 crossing move linear 20.0 0.0 0.0 units box
fix integrate rest nve
compute site all pe/atom
compute neighbors all coord/atom cutoff 3.5
compute stress all pressure NULL virial
thermo 1
thermo_style custom step pe c_stress[1] c_stress[2] c_stress[3] c_stress[4] c_stress[5] c_stress[6]
thermo_modify norm no format float %.16g
dump d all custom 1 ${out}/atoms.dump id type proc x y z fx fy fz c_site c_neighbors
dump_modify d sort id format float %.17g
timestep 0.001
run 14
